{{/UI}}

== Trivia ==
*The name '''Zodd''' could be a reference to [https://www.dc.com/characters/zod Dru-Zod], better known as General Zod, a villain from DC Comics, being the leader of Krypton's military forces.

*'''Zodd'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s skin could be based on the appearance of [https://www.dc.com/characters/vandal-savage Vandal Savage], an immortal villain from DC Comics, who served as an advisor and general to powerful leaders including Napoleon Bonaparte and Otto von Bismarck. Modern Era Vandal Savage has close ties to the government and war industry and is often depicted as having grey skin, a large gash over his left eye, and a large imperial pelisse.


